WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 11=

22
01:57.031 --> 01:58.270
I remember he sent you a lamp

23
01:58.470 --> 01:59.830
when I was at your place.

24
02:00.311 --> 02:01.750
Was it after the hot spring trip?

25
02:02.190 --> 02:02.671
Right.

26
02:03.231 --> 02:04.110
I almost forgot.

27
02:05.511 --> 02:07.270
I thought he had changed his mind,

28
02:07.550 --> 02:08.871
so I reached out a few times.

29
02:09.111 --> 02:10.111
He never replied

30
02:10.551 --> 02:11.670
and kept avoiding me.

31
02:14.070 --> 02:14.910
Avoiding you?

32
02:16.510 --> 02:17.790
He gave you a gift,

33
02:17.831 --> 02:18.910
ignored your messages,

34
02:19.591 --> 02:20.470
and avoided you.

35
02:21.871 --> 02:23.111
Why would he do that?

36
02:48.111 --> 02:48.910
So,

37
02:49.510 --> 02:50.871
since that lamp arrived,

38
02:51.431 --> 02:52.950
every conversation between us

39
02:53.871 --> 02:54.831
was heard by him.

40
02:57.750 --> 02:58.630
No wonder he was

41
02:58.670 --> 02:59.551
always one step ahead.

42
03:00.151 --> 03:01.431
He fed me empty promises,

43
03:02.431 --> 03:03.591
used me as a pawn,

44
03:04.431 --> 03:05.630
and tossed me aside.

45
03:05.910 --> 03:06.991
Should we

46
03:07.670 --> 03:08.910
make our move in response?

47
03:11.630 --> 03:12.391
What's your plan?

48
03:16.750 --> 03:17.311
Hello, Mom.

49
03:17.630 --> 03:18.111
Meng,

50
03:18.551 --> 03:19.950
come to the hospital.

51
03:20.510 --> 03:22.350
Your dad lost his temper.

52
03:22.910 --> 03:24.630
(He said having been hospitalized so long,)

53
03:24.790 --> 03:25.711
(he can't sleep well.)

54
03:26.031 --> 03:27.178
(He wants to be discharged.)

55
03:27.470 --> 03:29.391
(Hurry over. I can't stop him.)

56
03:31.190 --> 03:31.591
Mom,

57
03:32.111 --> 03:32.750
what's going on?

58
03:35.391 --> 03:35.910
Don't worry.

59
03:36.470 --> 03:37.311
Dad is asleep.

60
03:38.031 --> 03:38.991
Luckily, Ms. Hui's here.

61
03:39.431 --> 03:39.871
Ms. Hui?

62
03:47.991 --> 03:48.790
Why is she here?

63
03:50.670 --> 03:51.711
I came to see Dad earlier,

64
03:52.230 --> 03:53.470
and left a document.

65
03:53.711 --> 03:54.311
So I asked

66
03:54.311 --> 03:55.350
Ms. Hui to pick it up.

67
03:55.630 --> 03:56.190
She happened

68
03:56.190 --> 03:57.391
to see Dad losing his temper,

69
03:57.750 --> 03:58.711
so she stepped in.

70
04:01.311 --> 04:02.111
What a coincidence!

71
04:10.151 --> 04:11.311
Yu Meng is onto me now.

72
04:12.510 --> 04:13.431
She replaced the bed.

73
04:13.831 --> 04:14.910
Don't be overly alarmed.

74
04:15.510 --> 04:16.470
She's always been

75
04:16.591 --> 04:17.470
so unpredictable.

76
04:18.151 --> 04:19.110
When she replaced it,

77
04:19.110 --> 04:20.031
I wanted you to leave,

78
04:20.631 --> 04:21.670
but it'd seem suspicious.

79
04:22.271 --> 04:23.391
Now that her dad needs you,

80
04:23.910 --> 04:25.071
you have every reason

81
04:25.071 --> 04:25.591
to leave.

82
04:26.430 --> 04:27.230
Are you afraid

83
04:27.230 --> 04:28.230
I'd ruin the cozy world

84
04:28.310 --> 04:29.031
between you two?

85
04:29.511 --> 04:29.990
You hate

86
04:29.990 --> 04:30.790
having me around?

87
04:31.391 --> 04:32.391
Indeed.

88
04:33.631 --> 04:35.151
(Because when you're around,)

89
04:35.546 --> 04:36.790
(I have to play the loving husband)

90
04:36.790 --> 04:37.511
(to Yu Meng.)

91
04:38.230 --> 04:39.191
(Without you around,)

92
04:39.310 --> 04:40.191
(I'd feel at ease,)

93
04:41.230 --> 04:42.230
(as I wouldn't need to)

94
04:42.230 --> 04:42.910
(put on a show.)

95
04:43.550 --> 04:44.430
(I can focus on)

96
04:44.470 --> 04:45.110
(the company,)

97
04:45.951 --> 04:47.271
(and get us out of here soon.)

98
05:01.110 --> 05:02.831
Having our person around is more reassuring.

99
05:05.430 --> 05:06.751
Luckily, I gave Duan a bonus.

100
05:07.191 --> 05:08.110
She'll keep an eye.

101
05:08.303 --> 05:09.391
They don't dare act rashly

102
05:09.391 --> 05:10.591
in front of your mom

103
05:10.591 --> 05:11.191
and Duan.

104
05:12.631 --> 05:13.470
There's something

105
05:13.470 --> 05:14.550
I find rather strange.

106
05:14.910 --> 05:16.071
Lately, Mr. Tian

107
05:16.350 --> 05:17.550
always visits my dad.

108
05:18.191 --> 05:19.230
I've seen him for times.

109
05:19.430 --> 05:21.071
Maybe he just wants

110
05:21.110 --> 05:21.951
to cheer your dad up.

111
05:25.430 --> 05:26.910
I don't know if I'm overthinking it,

112
05:28.230 --> 05:29.550
but Mr. Tian's face

113
05:29.550 --> 05:30.071
looks tense.

114
05:30.670 --> 05:31.831
And every time he leaves,

115
05:32.071 --> 05:32.990
he's always in a rush,

116
05:33.591 --> 05:34.631
leaving me no chance

117
05:34.631 --> 05:35.071
to chat.

118
05:35.350 --> 05:36.670
How's your dad been doing?

119
05:36.790 --> 05:38.031
Is his sleep getting better?

120
05:39.990 --> 05:41.110
No.

121
05:41.670 --> 05:42.990
Today, he even chewed Duan out

122
05:43.071 --> 05:44.350
somehow.

123
05:45.031 --> 05:45.790
Tell Duan

124
05:45.990 --> 05:46.951
to try to eavesdrop

125
05:47.031 --> 05:47.751
on them.

126
05:49.711 --> 05:50.870
It's quite strange, right?

127
05:51.031 --> 05:52.071
Your dad's been hospitalized for so long.

128
05:52.071 --> 05:53.591
A shareholder visiting frequently

129
05:54.151 --> 05:55.071
isn't a good sign.

130
05:56.071 --> 05:56.951
I'll text her now.

131
05:59.071 --> 06:00.831
Can a lawyer tell someone to eavesdrop?

132
06:01.391 --> 06:02.470
You can't close your ears.

133
06:02.631 --> 06:03.550
How can you avoid it?

134
06:06.230 --> 06:06.591
I...

135
06:06.790 --> 06:07.631
I have to go.

136
06:07.831 --> 06:08.550
What?

137
06:08.550 --> 06:09.990
Going to eavesdrop yourself?

138
06:09.990 --> 06:10.591
No.

139
06:10.631 --> 06:12.071
The device for Kang Long arrived.

140
06:12.230 --> 06:12.951
I'll receive it.

141
06:13.350 --> 06:14.910
Aren't you in charge of marketing?

142
06:15.031 --> 06:15.751
Why do they dump

143
06:15.751 --> 06:16.470
everything on you?

144
06:17.430 --> 06:18.550
We're still short-staffed.

145
06:18.670 --> 06:19.271
Right now,

146
06:19.350 --> 06:21.110
I'll just help wherever I can.

147
06:21.511 --> 06:22.790
You've really changed.

148
06:22.990 --> 06:24.230
Back then, you slacked off

149
06:24.230 --> 06:25.071
wherever you could.

150
06:25.631 --> 06:26.310
I'll go with you.

151
06:26.430 --> 06:26.990
Me too.

152
06:28.071 --> 06:28.550
Let's go.

153
06:28.831 --> 06:29.350
See you.

154
06:30.631 --> 06:31.031
Bye.

155
06:34.511 --> 06:35.430
Finally done.

156
06:35.591 --> 06:36.870
Meng works so hard.

157
06:36.990 --> 06:37.591
After this,

158
06:37.831 --> 06:38.591
she has to go

159
06:38.591 --> 06:39.631
to take care of Mr. Yu.

160
06:42.470 --> 06:43.350
Got plans tonight?

161
06:44.670 --> 06:45.711
I have a few questions

162
06:45.711 --> 06:46.511
for our next shoot,

163
06:46.790 --> 06:48.031
just us two.

164
06:48.751 --> 06:50.271
It's after hours.

165
06:50.831 --> 06:51.870
Do you really hate

166
06:51.951 --> 06:52.870
being around me?

167
06:53.391 --> 06:54.550
Well, I'll take my leave.

168
06:54.550 --> 06:55.110
Wait.

169
06:56.310 --> 06:56.951
Dr. Kang,

170
06:57.310 --> 06:58.031
no one wants

171
06:58.031 --> 06:59.271
to talk about work after hours.

172
06:59.271 --> 07:00.230
If you need anything,

173
07:00.230 --> 07:01.470
contact me during work hours.

174
07:01.831 --> 07:02.271
Bye.

175
07:03.951 --> 07:04.430
Bye.

176
07:08.310 --> 07:08.670
Zi,

177
07:08.990 --> 07:10.391
is Dr. Kang into you?

178
07:11.831 --> 07:13.110
Mind your own business.

179
07:16.071 --> 07:16.631
How's it?

180
07:16.910 --> 07:18.031
Wonderful.

181
07:18.511 --> 07:19.670
I didn't expect

182
07:19.951 --> 07:21.031
that my girl

183
07:21.271 --> 07:23.151
is getting the hang of taking care of me.

184
07:23.470 --> 07:25.350
You're like a pro now.

185
07:27.031 --> 07:27.470
Dad,

186
07:27.951 --> 07:29.310
your legs are

187
07:29.350 --> 07:30.151
so bony.

188
07:30.470 --> 07:31.631
You've lost so much weight.

189
07:33.870 --> 07:35.151
Of course.

190
07:36.071 --> 07:37.191
I got locked up

191
07:37.271 --> 07:38.670
in here every day.

192
07:39.040 --> 07:40.350
Good thing Mr. Tian and Mr. Dong

193
07:40.350 --> 07:41.430
visit you often

194
07:41.951 --> 07:42.790
to cheer you up.

195
07:44.110 --> 07:44.990
Don't mention them.

196
07:45.711 --> 07:46.350
I know exactly

197
07:46.391 --> 07:47.831
what they are after.

198
07:50.071 --> 07:50.870
What are they after?

199
07:51.310 --> 07:52.631
I don't want to talk about them.

200
07:55.151 --> 07:55.670
Meng,

201
07:56.990 --> 07:58.470
I have something here for you.

202
08:00.670 --> 08:01.831
Take a look.

203
08:03.910 --> 08:04.591
This is

204
08:05.670 --> 08:06.870
an insurance policy

205
08:07.151 --> 08:09.951
(Life Insurance Policy) I bought for you when you were born.

206
08:10.790 --> 08:11.591
The premiums

207
08:11.751 --> 08:13.031
are completely paid up.

208
08:13.870 --> 08:15.391
When you turn seventy,

209
08:15.870 --> 08:17.071
you can start collecting it.

210
08:17.831 --> 08:18.631
Seventy?

211
08:20.271 --> 08:21.670
Dad, it is so far away.

212
08:21.910 --> 08:23.031
Even I know it's unworthy.

213
08:25.031 --> 08:26.430
You've been in the business world

214
08:26.470 --> 08:27.591
for your whole life,

215
08:27.790 --> 08:28.591
yet you end up

216
08:28.790 --> 08:29.751
getting scammed?

217
08:29.870 --> 08:31.951
When you turn seventy,

218
08:32.310 --> 08:34.271
I won't be around anymore.

219
08:34.790 --> 08:35.391
By then,

220
08:35.471 --> 08:37.351
you'll be an old lady.

221
08:37.950 --> 08:40.231
By then, if you want to call out

222
08:40.391 --> 08:42.111
"Dad, I want this,

223
08:42.111 --> 08:43.550
Dad, I want that,"

224
08:44.231 --> 08:45.910
I won't be there to give it to you.

225
08:46.231 --> 08:47.070
By then,

226
08:47.430 --> 08:48.950
take this money

227
08:49.550 --> 08:51.151
and buy whatever you want,

228
08:51.511 --> 08:53.351
as a gift from me,

229
08:53.391 --> 08:53.950
okay?

230
08:55.271 --> 08:56.351
Stop talking nonsense.

231
08:57.111 --> 08:58.550
You always say things like this.

232
08:59.790 --> 09:00.351
You and Mom

233
09:00.351 --> 09:01.430
will always be by my side.

234
09:01.790 --> 09:03.430
You two will live long.

235
09:03.790 --> 09:04.310
Heard me?

236
09:04.950 --> 09:05.471
Alright.

237
09:06.031 --> 09:06.991
Alright.

238
09:07.111 --> 09:08.151
Live long.

239
09:08.751 --> 09:09.910
(A divorce is a battle.)

240
09:10.751 --> 09:13.070
(I have to fight it alone.)

241
09:14.231 --> 09:15.430
(I can't drag them into it.)

242
09:15.991 --> 09:16.790
Today,

243
09:17.271 --> 09:18.991
I had a formal talk with Mr. Yu,

244
09:19.231 --> 09:19.950
but he refused.

245
09:20.511 --> 09:21.190
He said

246
09:21.550 --> 09:22.991
his body is still good,

247
09:23.310 --> 09:25.151
so no need to hand over the signing authority.

248
09:25.471 --> 09:26.310
I told him

249
09:27.031 --> 09:28.391
this is only

250
09:28.550 --> 09:29.231
for temporary.

251
09:29.871 --> 09:31.391
If he feels unwell one day,

252
09:31.790 --> 09:32.710
the company

253
09:32.950 --> 09:34.151
can still handle emergencies.

254
09:35.151 --> 09:35.670
But

255
09:36.271 --> 09:37.070
he got mad.

256
09:39.670 --> 09:40.790
When people are sick,

257
09:41.310 --> 09:42.231
they'd be sensitive

258
09:42.950 --> 09:44.151
and hate to hear these things.

259
09:44.670 --> 09:46.070
Dad has his pride.

260
09:46.511 --> 09:47.271
He would never

261
09:47.271 --> 09:48.190
show weakness.

262
09:48.950 --> 09:49.910
Mr. Yu isn't

263
09:50.031 --> 09:51.031
a stubborn man.

264
09:51.310 --> 09:51.790
Anyway,

265
09:51.950 --> 09:52.710
talk to him more,

266
09:53.190 --> 09:54.070
and he'll come around.

267
09:54.631 --> 09:56.151
You're his son-in-law.

268
09:56.670 --> 09:58.111
He will only delegate

269
09:58.111 --> 09:59.590
the interim signing authority to you.

270
10:00.031 --> 10:00.871
If anything happens

271
10:01.910 --> 10:03.031
before he authorizes you,

272
10:04.031 --> 10:05.288
at the shareholders' meeting,

273
10:05.351 --> 10:06.631
I'll stand by your side

274
10:06.830 --> 10:07.631
and fight for you.

275
10:15.031 --> 10:15.471
What is

276
10:15.550 --> 10:16.751
"interim signing authority"?

277
10:16.790 --> 10:17.670
When senior executives

278
10:17.670 --> 10:19.031
cannot perform their duties,

279
10:19.031 --> 10:20.070
they delegate their signing authority

280
10:20.070 --> 10:21.550
to a proxy temporarily.

281
10:21.991 --> 10:22.991
The proxy holds the power

282
10:22.991 --> 10:23.511
over

283
10:23.511 --> 10:24.190
major decisions,

284
10:24.231 --> 10:25.391
like fund transfers,

285
10:25.391 --> 10:26.231
and contract approvals,

286
10:26.231 --> 10:27.231
as the executives.

287
10:27.550 --> 10:28.471
Now I know why Di Liren

288
10:29.111 --> 10:30.271
wanted to send Lu Hui

289
10:30.271 --> 10:31.151
back to the hospital.

290
10:31.790 --> 10:32.751
And I know why Mr. Tian

291
10:33.391 --> 10:34.430
keeps visiting

292
10:34.430 --> 10:35.031
my dad.

293
10:36.511 --> 10:37.070
Di Liren

294
10:37.070 --> 10:38.430
wants the signing authority.

295
10:38.830 --> 10:39.471
Your dad agreed?

296
10:41.391 --> 10:41.991
Not yet.

297
10:44.710 --> 10:45.511
Did you

298
10:46.790 --> 10:47.271
cry?

299
10:53.190 --> 10:54.471
I have to secure

300
10:56.111 --> 10:57.058
this signing authority.

301
10:57.325 --> 10:59.638
(Outpatient)

302
11:23.790 --> 11:24.600
Why are you here?

303
11:24.950 --> 11:25.710
Here to see you.

304
11:27.151 --> 11:28.550
You kept avoiding me,

305
11:29.070 --> 11:30.070
so I had to come to you.

306
11:30.351 --> 11:30.991
What's up?

307
11:31.950 --> 11:33.310
You fired me

308
11:33.430 --> 11:34.631
so suddenly.

309
11:35.751 --> 11:36.670
You owe me a reason.

310
11:38.871 --> 11:40.511
Firing you wasn't my decision.

311
11:40.871 --> 11:41.830
The HR director

312
11:41.871 --> 11:42.511
decided it.

313
11:46.031 --> 11:46.910
If you need,

314
11:47.670 --> 11:48.070
I can

315
11:48.151 --> 11:49.070
get you a better job.

316
11:49.631 --> 11:50.830
Actually,

317
11:51.631 --> 11:52.550
I've been thinking

318
11:52.590 --> 11:53.351
about us.

319
11:55.830 --> 11:56.430
Time for us

320
11:56.430 --> 11:57.351
to get further.

321
11:59.190 --> 12:01.590
We agreed from the beginning.

322
12:01.991 --> 12:02.590
No divorce.

323
12:02.631 --> 12:03.471
I mean,

324
12:06.031 --> 12:06.910
let's break up.

325
12:09.871 --> 12:10.430
I know

326
12:11.830 --> 12:12.950
Yu Meng is keeping

327
12:13.310 --> 12:14.430
a close eye on you.

328
12:14.631 --> 12:15.550
I see it all,

329
12:15.710 --> 12:16.550
and feel bad for you.

330
12:17.070 --> 12:18.550
I know you try your best

331
12:18.790 --> 12:20.111
to look out for me,

332
12:20.351 --> 12:21.190
but you're helpless.

333
12:21.710 --> 12:22.631
So I think

334
12:23.190 --> 12:23.991
breaking up

335
12:24.351 --> 12:25.111
is best for us.

336
12:31.995 --> 12:35.105
(Delete Contact)

337
12:37.111 --> 12:37.790
Keep it.

338
12:39.310 --> 12:39.991
If you need help,

339
12:40.670 --> 12:41.351
just come to me.

340
12:52.391 --> 12:53.310
Then I wish

341
12:53.910 --> 12:54.710
the best for us.

342
13:27.910 --> 13:28.511
What's wrong?

343
13:28.790 --> 13:29.511
What's that?

344
13:30.070 --> 13:30.550
Nothing.

345
13:40.871 --> 13:42.670
That was a brilliant counterattack.

346
13:44.070 --> 13:44.751
Consider it

347
13:44.751 --> 13:45.710
my farewell gift to you.

348
13:46.670 --> 13:47.231
To be honest,

349
13:47.231 --> 13:48.271
when you told me the plan,

350
13:48.751 --> 13:49.710
I had my doubts.

351
13:50.910 --> 13:51.550
How did you know

352
